# Facts of ToolHinter (hinter.py, hinter_patterns.py). win.* are folds of the last calls (deque of Call, maxlen 16): host counts, the thresholds are the rules.
# win.screenshotsSinceWrite8 counts screenshots in the last 8 calls after the latest non-screenshot write (a screenshot does not reset the sequence — hinter_patterns.py:76-94).
# open.* = hintGate of each pattern, evaluated before its predicate (not suppressed, not in cooldown) — hinter.py:66-70.
CONTRACT unitymcp.hinter
COVERAGE declared-scope
MODULE hinter_facts
FACT call.cmd string
FACT env.reflectOn bool
FACT win.getComponent8 number min=0 max=16 integer
FACT win.sameTargetWrites6 number min=0 max=16 integer
FACT win.findObjects4 number min=0 max=16 integer
FACT win.screenshotsSinceWrite8 number min=0 max=16 integer
FACT win.recompile6 number min=0 max=16 integer
FACT win.getConsole6 number min=0 max=16 integer
FACT win.sameTargetSetProperty3 number min=0 max=16 integer
FACT open.inspectLoop bool
FACT open.batchWrites bool
FACT open.findThenRead bool
FACT open.screenshotSpam bool
FACT open.consolePoll bool
FACT open.redundantVerify bool
FACT hint.enabled bool
FACT hint.suppressed bool
FACT hint.callsSinceEmit number min=-1000000000 max=1000000000 integer
FACT adopt.isSuggested bool
FACT adopt.isTrigger bool
FACT adopt.ignoredBefore number min=0 max=1000 integer
INPUT hintPattern call.cmd env.reflectOn win.getComponent8 win.sameTargetWrites6 win.findObjects4 win.screenshotsSinceWrite8 win.recompile6 win.getConsole6 win.sameTargetSetProperty3 open.inspectLoop open.batchWrites open.findThenRead open.screenshotSpam open.consolePoll open.redundantVerify
INPUT hintGate hint.enabled hint.suppressed hint.callsSinceEmit
INPUT hintAdoption adopt.isSuggested adopt.isTrigger adopt.ignoredBefore
